    "long_instructions": "### **Campus Help Desk**\r\n\r\n#### **Do This:**\r\n\r\n1. **Review the example:** Look at the completed button. Notice how the function is written as a named arrow function and how it is connected using `addEventListener`.\r\n\r\n2. Read a function description for another button in `prompt.md`.\r\n\r\n3. Highlight the button description, select **Add to AI Tutor Chat**, and ask the AI to write a named arrow function that matches the description.\r\n\r\n4. Create an event handler using `addEventListener(\"click\", functionName)` and add your function.\r\n\r\n5. Click the button and confirm that it works as expected.\r\n\r\n6. Complete the same steps for the remaining buttons.",
    "display_name": "Campus Help Desk",
    "start_sources": {
      "folders": {
      },
      "files": {
        "1": {
          "id": "1",
          "name": "index.html",
          "language": "html",
          "contents": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <title>L4 — Campus Help Desk</title>\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css\">\n  <script defer src=\"script.js\"></script>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n  <h1>Campus Help Desk</h1>\n  <p>Create, assign, and close support tickets.</p>\n\n  <p>\n    Status: <span id=\"statusText\">Online</span>\n    &nbsp;&nbsp;\n    Queue: <span id=\"queueCount\">0</span>\n  </p>\n\n\n\n  <h2>Open Tickets</h2>\n  <p id=\"ticketCount\">0</p>\n\n  <p id=\"output\">Ready.</p>\n\n  <h2>Actions</h2>\n\n  <button id=\"newTicketButton\">New Ticket</button>\n  <button id=\"assignTicketButton\">Assign Tech</button>\n  <button id=\"closeTicketButton\">Close Ticket</button>\n  <button id=\"resetButton\">Reset</button>\n\n</body>\n</html>\n",
          "active": false,
          "folderId": "0"
        },
        "2": {
          "id": "2",
          "name": "style.css",
          "language": "css",
          "contents": "body {\n  margin: 0;\n  font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n  line-height: 1.5;\n  color: #0f172a;\n  background: #f7f7fb;\n  text-align: center;\n  padding: 24px 12px;\n}\n\nh1 {\n  margin: 10px 0;\n  color: #9a3412;\n}\n\nh2 {\n  margin-top: 24px;\n}\n\np {\n  margin: 8px 0;\n}\n\n#systemNotice {\n  margin: 16px auto;\n  max-width: 400px;\n  padding: 10px 12px;\n  border: 1px solid #fcd34d;\n  background: #fffbeb;\n  color: #92400e;\n  border-radius: 10px;\n}\n\n#ticketCount {\n  font-size: 32px;\n  font-weight: 800;\n  margin: 8px 0;\n}\n\n#output {\n  margin: 16px auto;\n  max-width: 400px;\n  min-height: 30px;\n  padding: 10px;\n  border: 1px dashed #cbd5e1;\n  border-radius: 10px;\n  background: #fbfdff;\n}\n\nbutton {\n  display: inline-block;\n  margin: 6px;\n  padding: 10px 14px;\n  border-radius: 10px;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  border: 1px solid #d1d5db;\n}\n\n\n\n#newTicketButton {\n  background: #d9f4cd;\n  border-color: #b4e694;\n  color: #127d37;\n}\n\n#assignTicketButton {\n  background: #dbeafe;\n  border-color: #93c5fd;\n  color: #1e3a8a;\n}\n\n#closeTicketButton {\n  background: #ffe2e2;\n  border-color: #ffc9c9;\n  color: #b91c1c;\n}\n\n#resetButton {\n  background: #f3f4f6;\n  border-color: #d1d5db;\n  color: #374151;\n}\n\nbutton:hover {\n  opacity: 0.7;\n}\n\n\n#statusText,\n#queueCount {\n  display: inline-block;\n  padding: 4px 10px;\n  border-radius: 999px;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  margin-left: 6px;\n}\n\n#statusText {\n  background: #dcfce7;\n  color: #166534;\n}\n\n#queueCount {\n  background: #e0f2fe;\n  color: #075985;\n}",
          "folderId": "0",
          "active": false
        },
        "3": {
          "id": "3",
          "name": "script.js",
          "language": "js",
          "contents": "const newTicketButton = document.getElementById(\"newTicketButton\");\n\nconst ticketCountDisplay = document.getElementById(\"ticketCount\");\nconst queueCountDisplay = document.getElementById(\"queueCount\");\nconst output = document.getElementById(\"output\");\n\nlet ticketCount = 0;\nlet queueCount = 0;\n\nconst createTicket = () => {\n  ticketCount = ticketCount + 1;\n  queueCount = queueCount + 1;\n\n  ticketCountDisplay.textContent = ticketCount;\n  queueCountDisplay.textContent = queueCount;\n  output.textContent = \"New ticket created.\";\n};\n\n\nnewTicketButton.addEventListener(\"click\", createTicket);",
          "folderId": "0",
          "active": true
        },
        "4": {
          "id": "4",
          "name": "prompt.md",
          "contents": "## New Ticket Button\nName of Button: New Ticket\nEvent: click\nWhat should happen: increase the ticket count and queue\nWhat on the page changes: the number of tickets, the queue number, and the message\n\n\n## Assign Ticket Button\nName of Button: Assign Tech\nEvent: click\nWhat should happen: decrease the queue\nWhat on the page changes: the queue number and the message\n\n\n## Close Ticket Button\nName of Button: Close Ticket\nEvent: click\nWhat should happen: decrease the ticket count\nWhat on the page changes: the ticket number and the message\n\n\n## Reset Button\nName of Button: Reset\nEvent: click\nWhat should happen: reset everything to 0\nWhat on the page changes: the ticket number, the queue number, the message, and the status\n",
          "folderId": "0",
          "active": false
        }
      },
      "openFiles": [
        "4",
        "3"
      ]
    },
